     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Describing a person",
     "texto": [
      "**Πώς είναι;** asks what someone is like. To describe appearance you can say **Είναι ψηλή** (she's tall) or **Έχει καστανά μαλλιά** (she has brown hair).",
      "**Φοράει** means «wears». Adjectives change according to gender: **ψηλός** (masculine), **ψηλή** (feminine), **ψηλό** (neuter). In **τα μαλλιά της**, «της» means her."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
